Pocket 3: a new MT button beside the zoom chip turns Med-Tele on and off, fading to black over the lens swap, and with Med-Tele on the chip offers 2x, 3x and 4x. Osmo Nano no longer shows zoom controls, and DISP lists Zoom Chip and Gimbal Stick only when the camera has them. Also new: experimental Multiview for up to four Pocket or Nano cameras. Fixed: clip delete in playback, live video stopping after connecting, and the assist palette covering the capture drawer.
